%% Data pipeline flowchart
flowchart TD
    U[Upload Resume File] --> TX[Text Extraction (pdf/docx->text)]
    TX --> SEG[Section Segmentation]
    SEG --> EXT[Entity & Skill Extraction]
    EXT --> EMB[Embedding (sentence-transformer)]
    EMB --> RET[Retrieve candidate questions (FAISS)]
    RET --> RANK[Rank & Deduplicate]
    RANK --> RESP[API Response: Top-k Questions]
    RESP --> UI[Frontend / Interviewer]
